							<category name="LaserBeamLowDistanceFix">
								<comment>#####################################################</comment>
								<comment>Beam Firing Mode Definition Fixes</comment>
								<comment>Eliminated the limited range of the beam weapons that made them unfavorable in the first place.</comment>
