						<category name="All - Throw grenades in FFYL v1.0.0">
							<comment>Mod author: Astor</comment>
							<comment>Release Date: 08 November 2018</comment>
							<comment>Version: 1.0.0 - See ReadMe for Changelog ;)</comment>
							<comment>Now you can throw grenades when you are in FFYL, and with any character! Enjoy.</comment>
							<comment>You Also Have a chance to perform a self attack</comment>
							<category name="Vodoo Magic">
								<hotfix name="GrenadesInFFYL" level="None">
									<code profiles="default">set Loader.TheWorld:PersistentLevel.WillowPlayerController_2 CanThrowGrenadesWhileInDownState 1.000000</code>
