								<comment></comment>
								<code profiles="default">set gd_cork_weap_assaultrifle.Name.Title_Dahl.Title_Legendary_MajorTom:AttributePresentationDefinition_8 NoConstraintText I want that rifle, Daddy!</code>
								<comment></comment>
