							<category name="MashersV4">
								<category name="Description">
									<comment>By Aaron0000</comment>
									<comment>Changes the double accessory of all pistols into the (in)famous Masher accessory.</comment>
									<comment>Mashers have a minor penalty in critical damage.</comment>
									<comment>Hyperion mashers only have x5 projectiles. They are however more accurate.</comment>
									<comment>Maliwan and Torgue mashers only have x6 projectiles, due to already having splash.</comment>
									<comment>Dahl mashers have a longer delay between series of bursts.</comment>
									<comment>Maggie's masher is different than normal mashers. Due to how the double accessory was modified, the Maggie's damage wound up being tripled, so damage was chopped by 66% to return it to normal. Then the pellet count was quadrupled to achieve the same overall damage boost as other mashers.</comment>
									<comment>Comes with custom prefixes: Jakobs = Mashin', Hyperion = Teamplay, Torgue = Septuple Penetrating, Scav = buncha, Maliwan = Septenary, Dahl = Multitude, Tediore = Seven for One, Vladof = Bolshevik.</comment>
									<comment>NOTES:</comment>
									<comment>If using the Revolvers patch, there is a fix for Maggie to make it mash properly. Located at the bottom.</comment>
									<comment>If using the Violator replacer for the 88 Fragnum, there is a patch for it down below to make it function correctly as a Masher.</comment>
								</category>
								<category name="Code">
									<category name="Prefixes">
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Jakobs.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Mashin'</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Hyperion.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Teamplay</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Torgue.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Gangbanging</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Scav.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName buncha</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Maliwan.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Senary</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Dahl.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Multitude</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Tediore.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Seven for One</code>
										<code profiles="default">set GD_Weap_Pistol.Name.Prefix_Vladof.Prefix_Laser_Double PartName Bolshevik</code>
									</category>
