							</category>
							<category name="Devils Ultimate Deal-Replaces Plunkett">
								<category name="Info">
									<comment>#Originally made by Lightchaosman, ported by Laxlife</comment>
									<comment>#Replaces the Plunkett, if it took more than one shot, you werent using a Jakobs</comment>
									<comment>#The Whale Killer is the ultimate jakobs sniper.</comment>
									<comment>#If you crit, the enemy dies.</comment>
									<comment>#If you dont crit, you deal no damage .</comment>
									<comment>#Holding this gun causes you to take 2.5x more damage.</comment>
									<comment>#Aiming down sights prevents movement.</comment>
									<comment>#Aiming down sights quickly drains your healthbar.</comment>
									<comment>#You become almost-immune to incoming damage while aiming down sights.</comment>
									<comment>#Aiming down sights gives more projectiles.</comment>
									<comment>#Getting a kill while aiming down sights, restores your health.</comment>
									<comment>#Increased scope speed.</comment>
								</category>
								<category name="Card">
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Petunia_Weapons.Name.Title.Title__Unique_Plunkett PartName Devil's Ultimate Deal</code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Petunia_Weapons.Name.Title.Title__Unique_Plunkett:AttributePresentationDefinition_8 NoConstraintText You should have read the Fine Print.<font color = "#FFFFFF"</code>
									<code profiles="default">set GD_Petunia_Weapons.Name.Title.Title__Unique_Plunkett rarity (BaseValueConstant=5.000000,BaseValueAttribute=None,InitializationDefinition=None,BaseValueScaleConstant=1.000000)</code>
								</category>
								<category name="Attributes">
