								<category name="Renamings">
									<code profiles="">set GD_GrenadeMods.Title.Title_SkyRocket PartName Levy</code>
									<code profiles="">set GD_GrenadeMods.Delivery.Delivery_SkyRocket:AttributePresentationDefinition_0 Description Cordswainer of the cosmos.</code>
								</category>
							</category>
							<category name="AtlasRebornV3">
								<category name="Description">
									<comment>By Aaron0000</comment>
									<comment>Atlas Reborn</comment>
									<comment>Completely overhauls the Vladof manufacturer into Atlas from Borderlands 1.</comment>
									<category name="List of changes">
										<comment>Most Vladof items (excluding class mods/oz kits and some unique/legendary items) have been reskinned and renamed. Names are based off of Greek weapons and prefixes are based off of "superiority" as well as a few BL1 prefixes (List of Prefixes and Titles can be found below).</comment>
										<comment>Atlas Weapons have been globally rebalanced. The stats should be above average in all aspects.</comment>
										<comment>Most special weapons have been replaced or adjusted. Details down below.</comment>
										<comment>Atlas weapons have the feature of increasing action skill cooldown while held.</comment>
									</category>
									<category name="Notes">
										<comment>If using the community patch, load this file after the community patch. In general, load this file last.</comment>
										<category name="Reticle">
											<comment>If you're having issues with reticles disappearing, it is a known issue. Due to gearbox wizardry, depending on the grip of a weapon, and the barrel of said weapon, the scoped view will have missing parts when using the Atlas logo. Find this line in the file:</comment>
											<comment>GD_Manufacturers.Manufacturers.Vladof FlashLabelName Atlas</comment>
											<comment>and disable it or use FilterTool.</comment>
										</category>
									</category>
									<category name="Replacers & Renamings">
										<category name="Replacers">
											<comment>Shredifier -> Griffin</comment>
											<comment>Mongol -> Hydra</comment>
											<comment>Proletarian Revolution -> Troll</comment>
											<comment>The Machine -> Argus</comment>
											<comment>Ice Scream -> Ajax's Spear</comment>
											<category name="Details">
												<category name="Griffin">
													<comment>Boosted base stats (Damage, accuracy, fire rate, magazine size, reload speed, recoil).</comment>
													<comment>Further boosted Action Skill cooldown.</comment>
													<comment>Increased projectile speed.</comment>
													<comment>Only spawns in elemental versions.</comment>
												</category>
												<category name="Hydra">
													<comment>Fires five rockets in a horizontal spread.</comment>
													<comment>Actually does consume reduced ammo.</comment>
													<comment>Decreased damage per projectile.</comment>
													<comment>Increased accuracy.</comment>
												</category>
												<category name="Troll">
													<comment>Minor stat boosts.</comment>
													<comment>Increases damage resistance to all types while wielded (except fire).</comment>
													<comment>Grants health regeneration while held.</comment>
												</category>
												<category name="Argus">
													<comment>Behaves like a shotgun when hip-fired, and like a sniper rifle when aiming down sights.</comment>
													<comment>Decreased critical hit damage when hip-fired, increased critical damage when aiming down sights.</comment>
													<comment>Extended magazine capacity.</comment>
												</category>
												<category name="Ajax's Spear">
													<comment>Still has the same Melee effects as the Rapier. Just made it more effective as an actual gun.</comment>
													<comment>Increased base damage.</comment>
													<comment>Significantly reduced spread.</comment>
													<comment>Heavily reduced recoil.</comment>
												</category>
											</category>
										</category>
										<category name="Renamings">
											<comment>Sham -> Aegis</comment>
											<comment>Kala -> Omega</comment>
											<comment>Fire Bee -> Phoenix</comment>
											<comment>Storm Front -> Steropes</comment>
											<comment>Pandemic -> Python</comment>
										</category>
										<category name="Adjustments">
											<category name="Kitten">
												<comment>Gave Kitten a new, tighter spread and reduced the damage slightly to compensate.</comment>
											</category>
											<category name="Hail">
												<comment>Cut the arc of Hail in half.</comment>
											</category>
										</category>
									</category>
									<category name="Prefixes">
										<comment>Atlas Prefix ------------- Prefix type -------------------------- Vladof Prefix</comment>
										<category name="Shared">
											<comment>Noteworthy -------------- Bandit grip --------------------------- Forlorn</comment>
											<comment>High-Caliber ------------ Jakobs grip --------------------------- Oppressed/Sladky</comment>
											<comment>Impressive -------------- Torgue grip --------------------------- Grim</comment>
											<comment>Solid ------------------- Dahl grip ----------------------------- Woeful/Nochy</comment>
											<comment>Pearl ------------------- Vladof grip --------------------------- Angry/Kot</comment>
											<comment>Implacable -------------- Hyperion grip ------------------------- Despair/Sneety</comment>
											<comment>Consistent -------------- Tediore grip -------------------------- Icy</comment>
										</category>
										<category name="Assault Rifles">
											<comment>Siege ------------------- Basic --------------------------------- Assault</comment>
											<comment>Optimal ----------------- BanditClamp (Damage) ------------------ Ferocious</comment>
											<comment>Supreme ----------------- BanditClamp (Wild) -------------------- Rabid</comment>
											<comment>Impaling ---------------- Bayonet ------------------------------- Skewering</comment>
											<comment>Surpassing -------------- Box BulletSpeed ----------------------- Swift</comment>
											<comment>Prevailing -------------- Stability Foregrip -------------------- Resolute</comment>
											<comment>Maximal ----------------- Magazine Size ------------------------- Expansive</comment>
											<comment>Distinguishing ---------- Accuracy ------------------------------ Severe</comment>
											<comment>Flaming ----------------- Incendiary ---------------------------- Hot</comment>
											<comment>Static ------------------ Shock --------------------------------- Sapping</comment>
											<comment>Caustic ----------------- Corrosive ----------------------------- Corrosive</comment>
											<comment>Frigid ------------------ Cryo ---------------------------------- Icy</comment>
										</category>
										<category name="Sniper Rifles">
											<comment>Superb ------------------ Damage -------------------------------- Gromky</comment>
											<comment>Bisecting --------------- Bayonet ------------------------------- Britva</comment>
											<comment>Choice ------------------ Accurate ------------------------------ Zammechat</comment>
											<comment>Expert ------------------ Critical ------------------------------ Razrez</comment>
											<comment>Steadfast --------------- Stability ----------------------------- Dobby</comment>
											<comment>Exceeding --------------- Magazine ------------------------------ Bolshy</comment>
											<comment>Incredible -------------- Fire Rate ----------------------------- Skorry</comment>
											<comment>Burning ----------------- Incendiary ---------------------------- Phospher</comment>
											<comment>Lightning --------------- Shock --------------------------------- Strack</comment>
											<comment>Vitrolic ---------------- Corrosive ----------------------------- Splodge</comment>
											<comment>Chilling ---------------- Cryo ---------------------------------- Bolnoy</comment>
										</category>
										<category name="Pistols">
											<comment>Prime ------------------- Tech 2 (Damage) -----------------------</comment>
											<comment>Slashing ---------------- Bayonet  ------------------------------ Patriot's</comment>
											<comment>Infallible -------------- Laser (Accuracy) ---------------------- Righteous</comment>
											<comment>Immovable --------------- Stock (Stability) --------------------- Resolute</comment>
											<comment>Endless ------------- --- Magazine ------------------------------ Unending</comment>
											<comment>Immeasurable ------------ Fire rate ----------------------------- Vengeful</comment>
											<comment>Untold ------------------ Double -------------------------------- Dva</comment>
											<comment>Incendiary -------------- Incendiary ---------------------------- Burning</comment>
											<comment>Shock ------------------- Shock --------------------------------- Discharge</comment>
											<comment>Corrosive --------------- Corrosive ----------------------------- Caustic</comment>
											<comment>Freezing ---------------- Cryo ---------------------------------- Cryo</comment>
										</category>
										<category name="Rocket Launchers">
											<comment>Grand ------------------- Tip Cover (Damage) -------------------- Rugged</comment>
											<comment>Scrupulous -------------- Body Mod 2 (Accuracy) ----------------- Victorious</comment>
											<comment>Uninteruptable ---------- Gripper (Reload) ---------------------- Ruthless</comment>
											<comment>Mercurial --------------- Handle (Swap Speed) ------------------- Moscovite's</comment>
											<comment>Velocious --------------- Stock Cover (Speed) ------------------- Partisan</comment>
											<comment>Insurpassable ----------- Stocktube (Fire Rate) ----------------- Turbulent</comment>
											<comment>Unrelenting ------------- Body Mod 1 (Mag Size) ----------------- Worker's</comment>
											<comment>Cleaving ---------------- Bandit Grip (Melee) ------------------- Revolt</comment>
											<comment>Combustion -------------- Incendiary ---------------------------- Red</comment>
											<comment>Fulgragating ------------ Shock --------------------------------- Shock</comment>
											<comment>Pestilent --------------- Corrosive ----------------------------- Virulent</comment>
											<comment>Cooling -------------- Cryo ---------------------------------- Opposing</comment>
										</category>
										<category name="Shields">
											<comment>Ace --------------------- Basic --------------------------------- Socialized</comment>
											<comment>Indivisble -------------- Capacity 1 ---------------------------- Traitorous</comment>
											<comment>Indomitable ------------- Capacity 2 ---------------------------- Meek</comment>
											<comment>Indestructable ---------- Capacity 3 ---------------------------- Righteous</comment>
											<comment>Impenetrable ------------ Capacity 4 ---------------------------- Unyielding</comment>
											<comment>Invincible -------------- Capacity 5 ---------------------------- Unbroken</comment>
											<comment>Cut-Above --------------- Rate 1 -------------------------------- Cowardly</comment>
											<comment>High-Class -------------- Rate 2 -------------------------------- Timid</comment>
											<comment>Five-Star --------------- Rate 3 -------------------------------- Momentous</comment>
											<comment>Unrivaled --------------- Rate 4 -------------------------------- Mobilized</comment>
											<comment>Alacritous -------------- Rate 5 -------------------------------- Revolutionary</comment>
											<comment>Centisecond ------------- Delay 1 ------------------------------- Apathetic</comment>
											<comment>Millisecond ------------- Delay 2 ------------------------------- Torpid</comment>
											<comment>Microsecond ------------- Delay 3 ------------------------------- Ever-Alert</comment>
											<comment>Nanosecond -------------- Delay 4 ------------------------------- Vigilant</comment>
											<comment>Immediate --------------- Delay 5 ------------------------------- Watchful</comment>
											<comment>Good -------------------- Special 1 ----------------------------- Oppressive</comment>
											<comment>Admirable --------------- Special 2 ----------------------------- Restrictive</comment>
											<comment>Remarkable -------------- Special 3 ----------------------------- Guerilla</comment>
											<comment>Exceptional ------------- Special 4 ----------------------------- Liberated</comment>
											<comment>The Best ---------------- Special 5 ----------------------------- Proud</comment>
										</category>
									</category>
									<category name="Titles">
										<comment>Atlas Title ------------- Item type ----------------------------- Vladof Item Replaced</comment>
										<comment>Rifle ------------------- Standard assault rifles --------------- Rifle</comment>
										<comment>Xyston ------------------ Minigun barrel assault rifle ----------</comment>
										<comment>Kontos ------------------ Torgue barrel assault rifle -----------</comment>
										<comment>Sarrisae ---------------- Jakobs barrel assault rifle -----------</comment>
										<comment>Doru -------------------- Dahl barrel assault rifle -------------</comment>
										<comment>Toxa -------------------- Standard Sniper Rifle -----------------</comment>
										<comment>Akontia ----------------- Jakobs Barrel Sniper Rifle ------------</comment>
										<comment>Oistos ------------------ Hyperion Barrel Sniper Rifle ----------</comment>
										<comment>Sfendonai --------------- Vladof Barrel Sniper Rifle ------------</comment>
										<comment>Gastraphetes ------------ E-Tech Barrel Sniper Rifle ------------</comment>
										<comment>Xiphos ------------------ Standard pistols ----------------------</comment>
										<comment>Machaira ---------------- Vladof barrel pistol ------------------</comment>
										<comment>Parazonium -------------- Torgue barrel pistol ------------------</comment>
										<comment>Kopis ------------------- Jakobs barrel pistol ------------------</comment>
										<comment>Spatha ------------------ Hyperion barrel pistol ----------------</comment>
										<comment>Ballista ---------------- Standard launcher ---------------------</comment>
										<comment>Lithoboloi -------------- Maliwan barrel launcher ---------------</comment>
										<comment>Palintonos -------------- Torgue barrel launcher ----------------</comment>
										<comment>Polybolos --------------- Vladof barrel launcher ----------------</comment>
